{
  "title": "EFS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 Linux 기반 컴퓨팅 자원에서 공유하는 관리형 NFS 파일 시스템이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic File System)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#regional-and-one-zone\">Regional and One Zone</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#mount-targets-and-nfs\">Mount Targets and NFS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#elastic-throughput\">Elastic Throughput</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#provisioned-and-bursting-throughput\">Provisioned and Bursting Throughput</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#general-purpose-and-max-i-o\">General Purpose and Max I/O</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#standard-infrequent-access-and-archive\">Standard, Infrequent Access and Archive</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#access-points\">Access Points</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#encryption-and-iam-authorization\">Encryption and IAM Authorization</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#replication-and-backup\">Replication and Backup</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>20 / 62</span></div><h1>EFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic File System)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 9 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon EFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic File System)</span>는 Linux Workload를 위한 관리형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">File Storage</a>다. 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>·Container·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>가 File System의 공통 경로를 사용할 수 있으며 저장 용량이 자동으로 확장된다.</p><p>Regional File System과 One Zone은 장애 범위가 다르다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a> Mode, Performance Mode, Storage Class를 서로 다른 설정 축으로 이해해야 올바른 비용·성능 구성을 선택할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"공유 파일과 접근 경계\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>공유 파일과 접근 경계</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>AZ A client</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> / Container A</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> Client</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Mount Target A</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Regional EFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic File System)</span></strong><small>공통 File System</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>AZ B client</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> / Container B</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> Client</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Mount Target B</strong><small>같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 접근 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Same Regional EFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic File System)</span></strong><small>File·Directory 공유</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·Access Point·POSIX Permission을 함께 평가한다. One Zone은 별도 장애 모델이다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"regional-and-one-zone\"><h2>Regional and One Zone<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#regional-and-one-zone\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Regional은 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 데이터를 저장하고 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Mount Target으로 접근하게 설계한다. One Zone은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 저장해 비용을 낮추지만 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 손실 위험을 고려해야 한다. 재생성할 수 없는 유일한 원본에는 복제·Backup·복원력 요구를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"mount-targets-and-nfs\"><h2>Mount Targets and NFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Network File System)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#mount-targets-and-nfs\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Mount Target은 Subnet의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 통해 NFS4.0·4.1 접근 경로를 제공한다. Client와 Target의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>에 필요한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> 통신을 허용한다. 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Client는 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Mount Target을 사용하도록 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>·Network 경로를 설계한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"elastic-throughput\"><h2>Elastic Throughput<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#elastic-throughput\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Workload 활동에 맞춰 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>을 자동 조정해 관리 부담을 줄인다. 사용량 기반 비용과 지원 File System·Performance Mode 조건을 확인한다. 처리량이 오래 일정한 경우 다른 Mode와 총비용을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"provisioned-and-bursting-throughput\"><h2>Provisioned and Bursting Throughput<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#provisioned-and-bursting-throughput\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Provisioned는 필요 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>을 설정하고 Bursting은 저장량에 따른 기본 처리량과 Credit을 사용한다. 큰 Burst가 길게 지속되면 Credit과 필요한 평균 처리량을 확인한다. Storage 용량을 불필요하게 늘려 성능만 확보하는 설계와 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"general-purpose-and-max-i-o\"><h2>General Purpose and Max I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#general-purpose-and-max-i-o\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>General Purpose는 일반적으로 권장되며 낮은 지연의 Workload에 맞는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#general-purpose-and-max-i-o\">Max I/O</a>는 지원 기존 구성에서 대규모 병렬 처리 요구를 다루지만 지연·새 기능 지원 제약이 다르다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a> Mode와 Performance Mode를 동일한 설정으로 보지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"standard-infrequent-access-and-archive\"><h2>Standard, Infrequent Access and Archive<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#standard-infrequent-access-and-archive\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>자주 읽는 Standard와 드문 접근의 IA <span class=\"full-name\">(Infrequent Access)</span>·Archive에 Lifecycle 정책으로 File을 배치한다. Retrieval·최소 보관과 Archive 지원 조건을 고려한다. 모든 File System 유형에서 모든 Class·Mode 조합이 가능한 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"access-points\"><h2>Access Points<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#access-points\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>앱별 Root Directory와 POSIX Identity를 지정하는 접근 경로다. 공통 File System에서도 앱의 경로·UID/GID를 분리할 수 있다. Network·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·POSIX 권한을 모두 확인해야 접근이 성립한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"encryption-and-iam-authorization\"><h2>Encryption and IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> Authorization<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#encryption-and-iam-authorization\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a>로 At-rest Encryption을, 지원 Mount Helper의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a>로 In-transit Encryption을 적용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> Authorization과 File System Policy는 Client의 Mount·Write·Root 접근을 제어한다. POSIX Permission이 별도로 적용되는 점도 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"replication-and-backup\"><h2>Replication and Backup<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#replication-and-backup\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>EFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic File System)</span> Replication은 지원 대상 File System에 데이터 복제를 제공한다. Backup은 이전 시점 Restore를 위한 별도 보호 수단이다. 잘못된 파일 변경이 복제될 수 있어 Replication만으로 과거 버전 보호가 완성되지는 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Linux 웹 서버가 같은 업로드 Directory를 읽어야 하면 Regional EFS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic File System)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 Mount Target을 사용한다. Windows <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>·AD 요구는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> for Windows를 검토한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>Windows <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> 공유가 필요하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">FSx for Windows File Server</a>를 검토한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/efs/latest/ug/whatisefs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">efs/latest/ug/whatisefs.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q047\" data-question=\"Q047\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q047</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Linux EC2 instances in multiple AZs must share the same files through a POSIX/NFS interface. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Each instance&#x27;s local instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">One EBS volume directly attached across AZs</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 마운트 대상을 통해 여러 Linux 자원에서 공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q048\" data-question=\"Q048\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q048</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q048/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which managed file system supports SMB shares and Windows ACLs for Windows servers?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q048\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">FSx for Windows File Server</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>와 Windows 파일 기능에 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q050\" data-question=\"Q050\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q050</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company repeatedly transfers data from an on-premises NAS to EFS and S3 over the network and synchronizes changes. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snow Family only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 온라인 데이터 전송·동기화를 자동화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q100\" data-question=\"Q100\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q100</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q100/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application spans multiple AZs, but a proposal requires a server in AZ B to directly mount one EBS volume in AZ A without changes. What is the flaw?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Backups can be stored only in S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront is missing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume must be in the same AZ as the EC2 instance it attaches to</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q100\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 is required</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>를 넘는 공유 파일 접근은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 파일 시스템을 고려하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 데이터는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a> 복원 등으로 이동한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q044\" data-question=\"Q044\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q044</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q044/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can an EBS volume in AZ A be attached directly to an EC2 instance in AZ B?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The volume and instance must be in the same AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Both AZs are in the same Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the instance has a public IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q044\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if CloudFront is configured</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 볼륨과 연결 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>는 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>여야 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a>에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B에 새 볼륨을 만들 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">이전 용어 <b>Edge Location</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">다음 용어 <b>Elastic IP</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
